            {
              "name": "T2",
              "parties": [
                "A",
                "C"
              ],
              "remaining": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "derivation": "A 在 T1 會使 B 沒空位。回退 A 到 T2，B 用 T1，C 鎖在 T2。"
    },
